{# 1. APPAR — vit #}
<section class="mat-section">
  <div class="mat-section-inner">

    <div class="gen-ai-tools-intro">
      <p>Apparna och läromedlen som utvecklats av Generation AI-projektet finns fritt tillgängliga på <a href="https://www.gen-ai.fi/sv" target="_blank" rel="noopener">gen-ai.fi</a>. Totalt över 182&nbsp;000 användningar!</p>
    </div>

    <div class="gen-ai-tool-grid">

      {% for app in sovellukset[lang] %}
      <div class="gen-ai-tool-card">
        {% if app.image %}
          <div class="gen-ai-tool-card-image"><img src="{{ app.image }}" alt="{{ app.imageAlt }}" loading="lazy"></div>
        {% else %}
          <div class="gen-ai-tool-card-image gen-ai-tool-card-image--placeholder" aria-hidden="true">⚙️</div>
        {% endif %}
        <span class="gen-ai-tool-card-type">{{ app.type }}</span>
        {% if app.status == "active" %}
          <div class="gen-ai-tool-card-header"><span class="gen-ai-tool-badge gen-ai-tool-badge--active">Tillgänglig</span></div>
        {% elif app.status == "beta" %}
          <div class="gen-ai-tool-card-header"><span class="gen-ai-tool-badge gen-ai-tool-badge--beta">Beta</span></div>
        {% elif app.status == "coming" %}
          <div class="gen-ai-tool-card-header"><span class="gen-ai-tool-badge gen-ai-tool-badge--new">Kommer snart</span></div>
        {% endif %}
        <h3 class="gen-ai-tool-card-title">{{ app.title }}</h3>
        <p class="gen-ai-tool-card-desc">{{ app.desc }}</p>
        <div class="gen-ai-tool-card-meta">
          {% for tag in app.tags %}<span class="gen-ai-tool-tag">{{ tag }}</span>{% endfor %}
        </div>
        <div class="gen-ai-tool-card-links">
          {% if app.aboutUrl %}
            <a class="gen-ai-tool-card-about" href="{{ app.aboutUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Beskrivning</a>
          {% endif %}
          {% if app.status == "coming" %}
            <span class="gen-ai-tool-card-link gen-ai-tool-card-link--disabled">Kommer snart</span>
          {% elif app.status == "beta" %}
            <a class="gen-ai-tool-card-link" href="{{ app.appUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Prova betan ↗</a>
          {% else %}
            <a class="gen-ai-tool-card-link" href="{{ app.appUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Prova appen ↗</a>
          {% endif %}
          {% for lesson in app.lessons %}
            <a class="gen-ai-tool-card-curriculum" href="{{ lesson.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ lesson.text }}</a>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
        {% if app.license %}
          <div class="gen-ai-tool-card-legal">
            <span class="gen-ai-tool-legal-badge">{{ app.license }}</span>
            {% if app.privacyUrl %}<a class="gen-ai-tool-legal-link" href="{{ app.privacyUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Dataskyddsbeskrivning</a>{% endif %}
            {% if app.githubUrl %}<a class="gen-ai-tool-legal-link" href="{{ app.githubUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>{% endif %}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      {% endfor %}

    </div>

    <p class="mat-all-link"><a href="https://www.gen-ai.fi/sv" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Allt material på gen-ai.fi →</a></p>

  </div>
</section>

{# 2. UNDERVISNINGSENHETER — ljusgrön #}
<section class="mat-section mat-section--alt">
  <div class="mat-section-inner">
    <h2 class="mat-section-heading">Undervisningsenheter</h2>
    <div class="mat-curricula-grid">

      {% for unit in oppimateriaalit %}
        {% if lang in unit.lang %}
        <div class="mat-curricula-card">
          <span class="gen-ai-tool-card-type">{{ unit.typeLabel[lang] }}</span>
          <h3 class="mat-curricula-title">{{ unit.title[lang] }}</h3>
          <p class="mat-curricula-desc">{{ unit.desc[lang] }}</p>
          <div class="mat-curricula-meta">
            {% if unit.duration %}<span class="gen-ai-tool-tag">{{ unit.duration }} {{ unit.durationLabel[lang] }}</span>{% endif %}
            {% for tag in unit.appTags[lang] %}<span class="gen-ai-tool-tag">{{ tag }}</span>{% endfor %}
          </div>
          <a class="gen-ai-tool-card-link" href="{{ unit.url[lang] }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ unit.linkLabel[lang] }}</a>
        </div>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# 3. PUBLIKATIONER — vit #}
<section class="mat-section">
  <div class="mat-section-inner">
    <h2 class="mat-section-heading">Publikationer</h2>
    <div class="mat-pub-grid">

      <div class="mat-pub-card mat-pub-card--book">
        <div class="mat-pub-card-accent"></div>
        <div class="mat-pub-card-body">
          <span class="mat-pub-card-type">Faktabok</span>
          <h3 class="mat-pub-card-title">50 myter om AI och data</h3>
          <p class="mat-pub-card-desc">AI är varken magi eller undergång — men det är fullt av myter. Den här faktaboken avlivar 50 vanliga missuppfattningar baserat på forskningsrön. Skriven av 30 experter från fyra universitet, inom datavetenskap, juridik, pedagogik, sociologi och filosofi.</p>
          <p class="mat-pub-card-authors">Ett samarbete mellan projekten Generation AI och DataLit</p>
          <div class="mat-pub-card-actions">
            <a class="mat-pub-card-btn mat-pub-card-btn--primary" href="https://doi.org/10.58181/VP9789523972513" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ladda ner gratis (PDF) ↗</a>
            <a class="mat-pub-card-btn mat-pub-card-btn--secondary" href="https://vastapaino.fi/sivu/tuote/50-myyttia-tekoalysta-ja-datasta/5353057" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Vastapaino.fi ↗</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mat-pub-card mat-pub-card--case">
        <div class="mat-pub-card-accent"></div>
        <div class="mat-pub-card-body">
          <span class="mat-pub-card-type">Fallstudie</span>
          <h3 class="mat-pub-card-title">AI som lärandeobjekt och verktyg för kreativ verksamhet</h3>
          <p class="mat-pub-card-desc">Hur syns AI i barnens vardag och i skolan? Fallstudien undersöker AI både som lärandeobjekt och som kreativt hjälpmedel — med ett praktiskt fokus på lärarnas arbete.</p>
          <p class="mat-pub-card-authors">Generation AI-projektet, 2023</p>
          <div class="mat-pub-card-actions">
            <a class="mat-pub-card-btn mat-pub-card-btn--primary" href="https://www.generation-ai-stn.fi/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/GenAI_2023_Case-1.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Läs publikation (PDF) ↗</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

